 "letter_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-letter enc-cd-letter--medium\"\n         aria-label=\"LLaMa's read on this race\">\n  <header class=\"enc-cd-letter__head\">\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦙</span>\n    <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__title-block\">\n      <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__eyebrow\">LLaMa&rsquo;s read</p>\n      <h2 class=\"enc-cd-letter__title\">Predicted 1&mdash;2&mdash;3&mdash;4</h2>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <ol class=\"enc-cd-letter__slots\">\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-1\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥇\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            1st\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">15/8</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Buckland Belle</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 80 leads the field, form string 213212 shows consistent placement, and D:+ GF:+ removes the two most common excuses. Tom Marquand&#x27;s 16% strike rate seals the booking.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-2\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥈\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            2nd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">4/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Amarachi</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 69 with GF:+ going fit and two consecutive placed efforts in form; 4/1 reflects market respect despite a cold trainer yard.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-3\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥉\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            3rd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">9/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Rating</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 71 is the second-highest in the field, Rossa Ryan books at 18% career strike rate, and a class drop adds a further positive signal.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-4\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            4th\n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">14/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Blue Hero</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 62 with a win last time (form reads 812127) and a class drop; veteran at 8 but the most recent form figure is a 7 indicating he&#x27;s competitive at this level.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ol>\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__verdict\">Mr Fox has landed on Buckland Belle from the notebook at 13/8, and the data backs him entirely. SR 80, D:+, GF:+, a Cls:= run at the same level, Tom Marquand in the saddle — multiple signals stack in the same direction. The model ranks her first with her strongest drivers being speed rating and going fit; there is no credible counter-argument in this field at the prices available. Win only, 2 units at 15/8. Conviction band: high. The only genuine risk is a cold Sangster yard, but Buckland Belle&#x27;s own consistency outranks yard form at this class level — she has done it repeatedly and has no excuse today.</p>\n  \n\n  \n    <a class=\"enc-cd-letter__more\" href=\"https://www.saturday-racing.com/letters/bath-2026-09-29/1502/\">\n      Read the full letter &rarr;\n    </a>\n  \n</section>\n",
